      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُجْسِدَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a garment) <i>was made to stick,</i> or
<i>adhere, to the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَسَد</span> [or <i>body</i>]. (Fr, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِجْسَادٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (a garment) <i>was dyed so that it
stood up by reason of</i> [<i>the thickness of</i> ] <i>the dye.</i>
(ISK, S.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجْسَدٌ</span>.]

